---
alwaysApply: true
---
- Feel: trustworthy, clear, civic, premium.
- Premium, trustworthy look, but function first: large tap
  targets, high contrast, obvious primary action on every screen.
- Polish through typography, spacing, and restraint, not heavy
  effects. Keep it fast on budget phones.
- Colors: placeholder palette for now, final brand colors come
  later. Define all colors once as CSS variables (never hardcode
  hex values in components) so the palette can be swapped in
  one place.
- One readable font, generous spacing.
- Report counts and fix rates are the visual hero.
- Avoid generic AI-looking gradients and stock-template layouts.
- Mobile-first, then scale up to desktop.